## 10. Finalize gate

The **Finalize** button (bottom of "4. CF Structure") is **disabled** until all of the following are true:

- Section 1 (O.B Cash) has a value.
- Payables: O.B set; **every** row in the allocation grid (including residual auto-rows) has Payment terms selected; **every** required "Enter Free amount" cell has a value.
- Receivables: Same as Payables.
- Inventory: O.B set; every Purchases cell filled.
- Salaries & Benefits: O.B set; Jan Payment cell filled.
- Other Adjustments, Financing, Capex: optional sections — if a row is added, every period cell in that row must have a value (or 0).

Inline errors block Finalize and point to the first offending cell (same pattern as Budget Spec §9).

On Finalize, the CF is **saved** under the active budget and the user is routed to "5. CF Forecast" (§11).

Finalized CFs are **editable** (re-opening any section saves overwrite the same CF; no version history).

