## 15. Entity model (CF additions to the Budget entity model)

```
Budget
  └── CashFlow (one per finalized budget)
        ├── openingCash
        ├── PayablesSection
        │     ├── openingBalance
        │     └── AllocationRow[]  (Company, P&L, BudgetCategory, GLAccountId?, ServiceProviderName?, paymentTerm, priorPeriodCarryIn[])
        ├── ReceivablesSection
        │     ├── openingBalance
        │     └── AllocationRow[]  (Company, BudgetSection, GLAccountId?, CustomerName?, paymentTerm, priorPeriodCarryIn[])
        ├── InventorySection
        │     ├── openingBalance
        │     └── purchasesByPeriod[]
        ├── SalariesCFSection
        │     ├── openingBalance
        │     └── januaryPayment   (free input; Feb–Dec auto)
        ├── OtherAdjustmentsSection → ManualRow[] (description, amountByPeriod[])
        ├── FinancingSection        → ManualRow[] (description, amountByPeriod[])
        └── CapexSection            → ManualRow[] (description, amountByPeriod[])
```

All computed rows (Forecast table, WC breakdown, Dashboard tiles) are **derived** — not stored. They re-compute on every read.

